E WINN!</field></block></value><value name="ADD1"><block type="text" id="xv.+(LrJ|kgg6Nk|Q*Oh"><field name="TEXT">MADE BY SENSEI SPENCER</field></block></value><value name="ADD2"><block type="text" id="`Wl,;{]*ZUVgP.MIk{C~"><field name="TEXT">TRALSE? FLUE?</field></block></value><value name="ADD3"><block type="text" id="s;U),dU`I(3(Wx9`0W.W"><field name="TEXT">BUTTER SQUISHY</field></block></value><value name="ADD4"><block type="text" id="NU0|H%__1yScf_xGNxK@"><field name="TEXT">Will work for coffee</field></block></value><value name="ADD5"><block type="text" id="OoF~MfSHcm09!;.TI|lH"><field name="TEXT">GAME EDITION #2</field></block></value><value name="ADD6"><block type="text" id="RVyk.d)AGxUw:h%{+a``"><field name="TEXT">Check out the code!</field></block></value><value name="ADD7"><block type="text" id="d!!`F;+$@qP=R$SR%+0l"><field name="TEXT">xTear's EPIC adventure!</field></block></value><value name="ADD8"><block type="text" id="dO5J(fT_|RA/Hihn$2|2"><field name="TEXT">Void Venture, iykyk</field></block></value><value name="ADD9"><block type="text" id="iA,N*Q{+l5x)RE~j?uUf"><field name="TEXT">Can you find the duck?</field></block></value><value name="ADD10"><block type="text" id="uG$?J.FEa=/xVl-JmEBm"><field name="TEXT">LEGENDARY PERFORMANCE</field></block></value><value name="ADD11"><block type="text" id="/7bEp,8b+my|CzH(}jKS"><field name="TEXT">Now with a FIRE STAFF!</field></block></value><value name="ADD12"><block type="text" id="?W;?,UAXvs=!OTskc+-3"><field name="TEXT">WELCOME PETRIFIED WITHER</field></block></value></block></value></block></value><value name="fg"><shadow type="colorindexpicker" id="5MNyRMd/LD%;)XfX]`01"><field name="index">1</field></shadow><block type="device_random" id="-]A1,@YW[[L`F4i|VfeO"><value name="min"><shadow type="math_number" id="JrhNAzB`e5$QUD79|SJ?"><field name="NUM">1</field></shadow></value><value name="limit"><shadow type="math_number" id="V|$S8rh8l6i593Tk5_1@"><field name="NUM">7</field></shadow></value></block></value><